LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
# 使用Martini 3粗粒化力场计算PDMS上水的接触角
# -----------------------------------------------------
# 1. 初始化设置
# -----------------------------------------------------
units               real
dimension           3
boundary            p p f
atom_style          full

# 读取包含PDMS分子结构的data文件
read_data           pdms_ca_water_rep.data
Reading data file ...
